:"ākuḷi","gloss":"small drum"}],"gloss":"small drum"},{"surface":"பதலையடு","parts":[{"text":"பதலையடு","lemma":"பதலையடு","gloss":"with the patalai drum"}],"gloss":"with the patalai drum","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"சுருக்கி","parts":[{"text":"சுருக்கு","lemma":"curukku","gloss":"pack"},{"text":"இ","lemma":"i","gloss":"verbal participle"}],"gloss":"packing"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"செல்லாமோதில்","parts":[{"text":"செல்","lemma":"cel","gloss":"go"},{"text":"ஆம்","lemma":"ām","gloss":"will"},{"text":"ஓ","lemma":"ō","gloss":"interrogative"},{"text":"தில்","lemma":"til","gloss":"particle of desire"}],"gloss":"shall we not go indeed?"},{"surface":"சில்வளை","parts":[{"text":"சில்","lemma":"cil","gloss":"few"},{"text":"வளை","lemma":"vaḷai","gloss":"bangles"}],"gloss":"few bangles"},{"surface":"விறலி","parts":[{"text":"விறலி","lemma":"viṟali","gloss":"female dancer"}],"gloss":"female dancer"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"களிற்றுக்கணம்","parts":[{"text":"களிற்றுக்கணம்","lemma":"களிற்றுக்கணம்","gloss":"herd of male elephants"}],"gloss":"herd of male elephants","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பொருத","parts":[{"text":"பொரு","lemma":"poru","gloss":"fight"},{"text":"த","lemma":"ta","gloss":"past relative participle"}],"gloss":"fought"},{"surface":"கண்ணகன்","parts":[{"text":"கண்","lemma":"kaṇ","gloss":"place"},{"text":"அகன்","lemma":"akaṉ","gloss":"wide"}],"gloss":"wide-spaced"},{"surface":"பறந்தலை","parts":[{"text":"பறந்தலை","lemma":"paṟantalai","gloss":"battlefield"}],"gloss":"battlefield"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"விசும்புஆடு","parts":[{"text":"விசும்பு","lemma":"visumpu","gloss":"sky"},{"text":"ஆடு","lemma":"āṭu","gloss":"fly"}],"gloss":"flying in the sky"},{"surface":"எருவை","parts":[{"text":"எருவை","lemma":"eruvai","gloss":"vulture"}],"gloss":"vultures"},{"surface":"புசுந்தடி","parts":[{"text":"புசுந்தடி","lemma":"புசுந்தடி","gloss":"thick flesh"}],"gloss":"thick flesh","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தடுப்ப","parts":[{"text":"தடு","lemma":"taṭu","gloss":"block"},{"text":"ப","lemma":"pa","gloss":"infinitive suffix"}],"gloss":"blocking"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பகைப்புலம்","parts":[{"text":"பகை","lemma":"pakai","gloss":"enemy"},{"text":"புலம்","lemma":"pulam","gloss":"land"}],"gloss":"enemy land"},{"surface":"மரீஇய","parts":[{"text":"மரீஇய","lemma":"மரீஇய","gloss":"conquered"}],"gloss":"conquered","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தகைப்பெருஞ்சிறப்பின்","parts":[{"text":"தகைப்பெருஞ்சிறப்பின்","lemma":"தகைப்பெருஞ்சிறப்பின்","gloss":"of great excellence"}],"gloss":"of great excellence","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"குடுமிக்கோமான்","parts":[{"text":"குடுமி","lemma":"kuṭumi","gloss":"Kuṭumi"},{"text":"கோமான்","lemma":"kōmāṉ","gloss":"king"}],"gloss":"King Kuṭumi"},{"surface":"கண்டு","parts":[{"text":"கண்டு","lemma":"கண்டு","gloss":"having seen"}],"gloss":"having seen","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நெடுநீர்ப்புற்கை","parts":[{"text":"நெடு","lemma":"neṭu","gloss":"much"},{"text":"நீர்","lemma":"nīr","gloss":"water"},{"text":"புற்கை","lemma":"puṟkai","gloss":"gruel"}],"gloss":"watery gruel"},{"surface":"நீத்தனம்","parts":[{"text":"நீத்து","lemma":"nīttu","gloss":"leave behind"},{"text":"அனம்","lemma":"anam","gloss":"we"}],"gloss":"we left behind"},{"surface":"வரற்கே","parts":[{"text":"வரல்","lemma":"varal","gloss":"coming"},{"text":"கு","lemma":"ku","gloss":"for"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"to come indeed"}]}],"literal":"In the difficult forest fortress residence, the wife / without the hunting boys going to distant lands, / of the short-legged monitor lizard caught in a trap, / porridge with curd and added rich fat, / bounteous good things, together with bards, / she who desires to serve incoming guests, and the husband, / attacking to shatter in the difficult battle, in the great battle, / majestic elephants adorned with / gold-made forehead plates, he is the recipient of great gifts! / Packing the good lute, small drum, and patalai drum, / shall we not go indeed, O female dancer with few bangles, / to the wide battlefield where herds of male elephants fought, / where vultures flying in the sky are blocked by thick flesh, / having conquered the enemy land, of great excellence, / having seen King Kuṭumi, / to leave behind our watery gruel and come?","translation":"In that difficult forest fortress, the wife of the bounteous householder—whose young hunting boys do not need to go to distant lands because they catch short-legged monitor lizards right in their traps—serves rich porridge mixed with curd and fat to bards and incoming guests. Her husband, who attacks and shatters enemies in fierce battles, has received majestic elephants adorned with golden forehead plates as great gifts! O female dancer wearing few bangles, let us pack our good lute, small drum, and patalai drum, and go! Having seen King Kuṭumi of great excellence, who conquered enemy lands—where in the wide battlefields where elephant herds clashed, the flight of vultures in the sky is blocked by thick pieces of flesh—let us go to him, leaving behind our watery gruel!","modern":"அரிய காவற்காட்டை உடைய இல்லத்தில் வாழும் மனைவி, வேட்டையாடும் சிறுவர்கள் தொலைதூர நாடுகளுக்குச் செல்லாமல் வீட்டருகே பொறியில் அகப்பட்ட குட்டைக் கால்களை உடைய உடும்பின் கொழுத்த தசை நெய்யைக் கலந்து தயிரோடு சமைத்த கூழினை, பாணர்களுடனும் புதிய விருந்தினர்களுடனும் மகிழ்ந்து உண்ணச் செய்யும் விருந்தோம்பும் பண்புடையவள். அவளுடைய கணவனோ, அரிய போர்க்களங்களில் பகைவரைத் தாக்கி அழித்து, பொன்னால் செய்த நெற்றிப்பட்டம் அணிந்த சிறந்த யானைகளைப் பரிசாகப் பெற்ற பெருங்கொடையாளி ஆவான். சில வளையல்களை அணிந்த விறலியே! நமது நல்ல யாழையும், ஆகுளி மற்றும் பதலை ஆகிய பறைகளையும் சுருக்கிக் கட்டிக்கொண்டு நாம் புறப்படுவோமாக! ஆண் யானைக் கூட்டங்கள் போரிட்ட அகன்ற போர்க்களத்தில், வானில் பறக்கும் கழுகுகளின் வழியைத் தடுக்கும் அளவுக்குத் தசைத் துண்டுகள் சிதறிக் கிடக்கும் பகைநாட்டைக் கைப்பற்றிய, சிறந்த பெருமையுடைய முதுகுடுமிப் பெருவழுதி என்னும் அரசனை நாம் கண்டு வணங்கி, நாம் உண்ணும் தண்ணீர்ப் போன்ற கஞ்சியை நீக்கிப் பெருவளம் பெற அவனிடம் செல்வோம்!","explanation":"A bard addresses a female dancer, urging her to pack their musical instruments and travel to the court of the Pandyan king Palyākasālai Mutukuṭumip Peruvaḻuti. The bard describes a wealthy householder in a forest fortress whose wife is extremely hospitable, serving rich monitor-lizard porridge to bards, and whose husband has received golden-plated elephants as gifts for his bravery. The bard then urges the dancer to leave behind their poor life of drinking watery gruel and visit King Kuṭumi, a fierce warrior who has conquered enemy lands, so they too can receive grand patronage. The poem contrasts the current poverty of the bards with the immense wealth of the patron's court and even the well-to-do forest dwellers. The battlefield is vividly described with vultures blocked in flight by the sheer volume of scattered flesh, emphasizing the king's terrifying military might and his capacity to conquer and distribute wealth.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,1.1],[1.18,1.5],[1.5,2.1],[2.1,3.2],[3.2,3.3],[3.3,3.5],[3.5,3.9],[3.9,4.7],[4.9,5.9],[5.9,6.2],[6.2,6.5],[6.5,6.7],[6.7,8.01],[8.01,8.06],[8.07,8.1],[8.1,9.4],[9.4,10.4],[10.4,10.6],[10.6,10.8],[10.8,11.4],[11.4,12.9],[12.9,13.2],[13.2,13.9],[13.9,14.5],[14.5,15.5],[15.5,15.82],[15.82,16.45],[16.45,17.1],[17.1,17.6],[17.6,17.6],[17.6,18.1],[19.0,19.7],[19.7,19.7],[19.7,20.49],[20.49,20.74],[20.8,21.6],[21.6,21.9],[21.9,22.05],[22.05,22.8],[22.8,24.0],[24.0,24.0],[24.0,24.4],[24.4,24.9],[24.9,25.9],[25.9,26.1],[26.1,26.2],[26.2,26.5],[26.5,27.1],[27.1,28.4],[28.41,28.44],[28.46,28.47],[28.47,28.47],[28.47,28.5],[29.18,31.2],[31.2,31.7],[31.7,32.3],[32.3,33.12],[33.12,33.23],[33.23,33.5],[33.5,34.43],[34.55,34.9],[34.9,35.3],[35.46,35.8]],"female":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,1.1],[1.2,1.6],[1.6,2.3],[2.3,3.2],[3.2,3.3],[3.3,3.6],[3.6,3.8],[3.8,4.7],[4.7,6.0],[6.0,6.3],[6.3,6.6],[6.6,6.8],[6.8,8.1],[8.1,8.6],[8.6,9.0],[9.0,9.6],[9.6,10.7],[10.7,10.9],[10.9,11.2],[11.2,11.9],[11.9,13.7]